    "rich_text_qX3zTt": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_fkmddj": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "a deep dive into shamballa jewels",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_NY37PL": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Designs that Stand Out</strong><br/>Whether you’re looking for something subtle or an eye-catching statement piece, we have it all. Our necklaces come in a myriad of designs – from simple, elegant chains to intricate, artistic expressions. Each necklace is created with care, ensuring you find the perfect match for any occasion, whether it’s for everyday wear or a festive evening.<br/><br/><strong>Unmatched Quality Materials</strong><br/>We never compromise on quality. Our necklaces are made from the finest materials, such as 18-karat gold, rose gold, white gold, and black rhodinated gold. Each necklace is designed to last, allowing you to enjoy them for many years to come. With a shiny finish and detailed craftsmanship, our necklaces will become your favorite pieces.<br/><br/><strong>Luxury with Diamonds and Precious Stones</strong><br/>Add a touch of glamour to your look with our necklaces adorned with white and black diamonds, as well as colorful gemstones. Each stone is carefully selected for its beauty and quality, creating a spectacular visual effect. When you wear one of our pieces, you are sure to attract attention and admiration.<br/><br/><strong>A Piece for Everyone</strong><br/>Our necklaces are designed for both men and women who appreciate exclusive and stylish jewelry. No matter your style, you can find a necklace that reflects your personality. Be prepared to add a special touch to your wardrobe with our unique designs.<br/><br/><strong>Visit Shamballa Jewels</strong><br/>Step into the enchanting world of Shamballa Jewels and explore our collection of necklaces in our store in Copenhagen or online. Our passionate team is ready to assist you in finding the perfect piece to complete your look. Discover the magic of our necklaces and let them be a part of your life’s journey.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
